<programme start="20261014055200 +0000" stop="20261014063500 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Eli Roth&apos;s History of Horror</title><sub-title lang="en">Ghost Stories</sub-title><desc lang="en">Ghost movies have been with movie viewers since the dawn of cinema; some ghosts are benevolent, some ghosts are malicious, but they all represent the mystery of what happens to people after death.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15814493_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
