<programme start="20261013140000 +0000" stop="20261013170000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Alabama-Birmingham at Memphis</sub-title><desc lang="en">The UAB Blazers visit the Memphis Tigers in an American Athletic Conference game. UAB beat Samford 33-14 for its second win. Memphis beat Charlotte 59-8 for its second win. Ryder Burton leads UAB, while Memphis is paced by quarterback Marcus Stokes.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ab.jpg"/></programme>
