<programme start="20261012130000 +0000" stop="20261012140000 +0000" channel="History 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">History&apos;s Greatest Mysteries</title><sub-title lang="en">The Amber Room: WWII Edition</sub-title><desc lang="en">One of World War II&apos;s greatest unsolved mysteries: an incomparable work of art worth half a billion dollars, lost without a trace; perhaps the single most valuable object the Nazis ever stole, the quest for this treasure has lasted over 75 years.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18974386_b_v12_bw.jpg"/></programme>
