<programme start="20261012190000 +0000" stop="20261012200000 +0000" channel="History 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">History&apos;s Greatest Mysteries</title><sub-title lang="en">The Shot Heard Round the World</sub-title><desc lang="en">When the British Red Coats march into Lexington in 1775 prepared for a surprise attack, they are met with a small scrappy militia ready for a fight; it&apos;s the battle that kicked off the American Revolution.</desc><credits><actor>Robert R. Cargill</actor><actor>Caroline Cory</actor><actor>Michael Dennin</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18974386_b_v12_bw.jpg"/></programme>
