<programme start="20261012110000 +0000" stop="20261012120000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Survivors</sub-title><desc lang="en">From the wreckage of three airplane crashes, survivors emerge to tell harrowing tales and provide critical data about what to do in an emergency.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012120000 +0000" stop="20261012130000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Deadly Discussions</sub-title><desc lang="en">A shocking error in the cockpit causes the crash of a 737 on takeoff and leaves an entire nation reeling.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012130000 +0000" stop="20261012140000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Storming Out</sub-title><desc lang="en">On its final approach to Charlotte, N.C., US Air Flight 1016 is engulfed in intense rain obstructing the view from the cockpit; the pilots abort the landing, but the aircraft crashes to earth, hurtling along a road and breaking apart.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012140000 +0000" stop="20261012150000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Poor Piloting</sub-title><desc lang="en">The crews of three doomed aircraft make catastrophic blunders.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012150000 +0000" stop="20261012160000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Northern Extremes</sub-title><desc lang="en">Faced with the extreme conditions of the far North, three flights fall out of the sky leaving investigators to uncover the cause.</desc><credits><actor>Jonathan Aris</actor><actor>Tre Smith</actor><actor>Shauna Bradley</actor></credits><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012160000 +0000" stop="20261012170000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Death in the Arctic</sub-title><desc lang="en">On 20 August 2011, First Air Flight 6560, a charter flight, crashes near its destination of Resolute Bay Airport, Resolute, Nunavut, Canada, in poor weather conditions; out of the fifteen passengers and crew members, only three survived.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012170000 +0000" stop="20261012180000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Who&apos;s Flying the Plane?</sub-title><desc lang="en">A look at accidents and incidents where problems with the interface between crew members and onboard avionics are a factor, and the causes of those problems.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
